~ start
$> locals.quest_title = "Lost Flute"
$> locals.quest_state = QuestManager.find_current_quest_by_title(locals.quest_title)
if !QuestManager.quest_accepetd(locals.quest_title)
	=> accept_quest
elif !locals.quest_state.is_completed
	=> submit_quest
else
	Nero: Thank you retrieve my flute!
=> END

~ accept_quest
Nero: Hey Hero, I lost my magical flute, would you kindly retrieve it for me?
Nero: I guess it's in the [b]Dark Dungeon[/b]!
- Ok (Accept quest)
	$> QuestManager.accept_quest(locals.quest_title)
	Nero: That's really kind of you!
- Not now, sorry
	Nero: Ok, I'll try my luck other ways.
=> END

~ submit_quest
$> locals.flute = inventory.get_slot_by_name("Magical Flute")
#$> debug(locals.flute)
Nero: Have you found my flute?
- Yes, take this (hand over flute) [if locals.flute /]
	$> inventory.consume_item(locals.flute.item_data)
	$> QuestManager.complete_quest(locals.quest_title)
	Nero: Oh, you're the savior, thanks!
- Not yet
	Nero: Nevermind, keep it up!
=> END